# Tron 2.0: Killer App (42560001), Nova. Built from the generic survey
# 1790951914-titleroutes2-68595 (lane.titleroutes2, read 2026-10-02).
# Read from its route-frames, not guessed:
#   boot20 (080334): ESRB card over PRESS START; boot40 (080356): black;
#     booted (080416): the KILLER APP title, PRESS START.
#   cycle 1 START (080424): an Xbox Live "Sign In" screen, two slots
#     ("Press A to play"), "Controller Disconnected" under each, and a
#     footer "B Skip Xbox Live sign-in".
#   every later press: A opens "Select account" (Guest / <New Account>),
#     the next press picks Guest ("Press A to sign in / Y to deselect"),
#     the next gives "At least one valid account must be chosen / OK", and
#     round again, for all 14 cycles and the play loop (080703..080754).
#   The survey never pressed B, the footer's way out.
# So: START at the title, then ONE B to skip the sign-in (a second B could
# back out of whatever menu follows), with a frame after each; then 10
# START/A cycles with a frame per press to map the menus
# past it (this run is the second survey as much as a route), mark, and a
# first-person loop (Tron 2.0 is an FPS: LY forward, RT fire, A jump, RX
# turn) with a frame per leg and no START.
# Replay 1 (1790953776-titleroutes2-447685, ref 77b3523fd3): the B came
# too soon. 4 s after START the title was still up (081413), the B landed
# before the Sign In screen did, and the run looped the sign-in as the
# survey did. A worse turn: in the play loop the sticks moved the account
# cursor to <New Account>, and A raised "This will send you back to the
# Xbox Dashboard to create a new account. Yes / No" (081911); a Yes would
# leave the game. v2 waits 10 s for the screen (it holds until input)
# before its one B.
wait 20
shot boot20
wait 20
shot boot40
wait 20
shot booted
press START
wait 10
shot signin
press B
wait 5
shot skip
repeat 10 {
    press START
    wait 5
    shot menu-start
    press A
    wait 5
    shot menu-a
}
mark gameplay               # CHECK: in a level, HUD up, no menu or sign-in screen
repeat forever {
    axis LY min
    wait 3
    shot fwd
    axis RT max
    wait 1
    axis RT min
    wait 1
    axis RX max
    wait 0.4
    axis RX mid
    wait 1
    shot right
    press A
    wait 2
    axis RX min
    wait 0.4
    axis RX mid
    wait 1
    shot left
    axis LY mid
    wait 0.5
}
